@startuml
title PayLink - Payment State Diagram
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

[*] --> Initiated : payment request accepted

state Initiated
state FundsHeld
state SentToBiller
state Unknown
state Failed
state Completed
state Rejected
state Refunded

Initiated --> FundsHeld : fraud approved / funds available\n[hold succeeds]
Initiated --> Rejected : fraud rejected or insufficient funds

FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : submit payment to biller
FundsHeld --> Failed : submission prevented / definitive failure\n[release held funds]

SentToBiller --> Completed : biller confirms success\n[capture held funds]
SentToBiller --> Failed : biller definitively refuses\n[release held funds]
SentToBiller --> Unknown : no response within 10 seconds\n[keep funds held]

Unknown --> Completed : late callback / status inquiry /\nreconciliation confirms success\n[capture held funds]
Unknown --> Failed : authoritative refusal or\nreconciliation confirms no payment\n[release held funds]

Completed --> Refunded : approved completed-payment refund\n[credit refund once]

Rejected --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
Completed --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

note right of Initiated
    Validate amount: 5..10,000 EGP.
    Check account, daily limit and velocity.
    Basic daily limit: 5,000 EGP.
    Verified daily limit: 30,000 EGP.
end note

note right of Unknown
    Funds remain held.
    Status inquiry only at +1, +5, +15 minutes.
    Never resubmit the payment.
    If still unresolved, remain Unknown until
    definitive callback or reconciliation evidence.
end note

note bottom of Failed
    Failed payment releases held funds.
    This is not a refund of a Completed payment.
end note

note bottom of Completed
    Terminal for ordinary bill-payment processing.
    Only the separately approved refund flow
    may transition it to Refunded.
end note

@enduml